{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35150","headline":"诗品二十四则 典雅 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 典雅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉壶买春，赏雨茆屋。\n坐中佳士，左右修竹。\n白云初晴，幽鸟相逐。\n眠琴绿阴，上有飞瀑。\n落花无言，人淡如菊。\n书之岁华，其曰可读。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}